{{(LU)}_{⏟}}_{A}x=b.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, setting $Ux=y,$ we obtain\n\n$$\nL{{(Ux)}_{⏟}}_{y}=b\\,⟹\\,{\\begin{aligned}Ly=b \\\\ Ux=y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now solve $Ly=b.$ Writing this equation in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives the system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1}=2 \\\\ 3{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to this system is ${y}_{1}=2$ and ${y}_{2}=-9.$ \n\nTherefore, $y=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-105755/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5250e0e1-4909-5075-8a8e-aa2f1be0bd9a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105755"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105760/selection/a0f09610273dff06f92e2ee2ee2ded34ffba8191eb9f374bd94d1a03c70f6545" :answer/id #uuid "69b5bd77-d816-58d0-818f-309d6afbf5f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -36\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105760/selection/3f41f03d7d0791172f27737fbfdb014fe274bc2a147ed40d556e00568377506f" :answer/id #uuid "9567ad29-733c-5c2f-a159-0d650178ed9d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ -34\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105760/selection/180dcaa007a16ac073b3e59fcffe4738b106e489a05783087fc8924dd7f5133f" :answer/id #uuid "c965cddd-b8d0-5acb-9540-025df157f1c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 34\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105760/selection/025718aa92abae903b6e9cae3daf768b110159c460963466d17222b90a4721c1" :answer/id #uuid "0d992b61-49b4-581f-9299-c049b5ce54e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 36\\end{aligned}]" :