5827e59a8481843f87c07bf57cd904d9f46b4" "q-107174/selection/97950ad2cf2d58bfbc1c0275d67b96733def2fbf86707674ee5dfdbc5397d084" "q-107174/selection/3ce3a0d20cd3f22508a98478fd97c202da86497f5aa05cb833c01f6472352afe" "q-107174/selection/b0f5f9ee0303612714b771c0ad8f5a99242f01c79360bb1a06a4fb349edc0792" "q-107174/selection/041f756147e399194699587759ec72c14df13f7fc9cbbcd5ecd7d44a3b19c763"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-107174" :question/id #uuid "910827ac-326a-5bf3-8b02-67a9b84939ee" :question/math-academy-id "q-107174" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $L$ and the vector $b,$ given by \n\n$$\nL=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -4 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf $A=LU$ is the LU factorization of some $3\\times 3$ matrix $A,$ find the vector $y$ such that\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}Ly=b \\\\ Ux=y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nis equivalent to $Ax=b.$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that since $A=LU,$ we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax=b\\,⟹\\,{{(LU)}_{⏟}}_{A}x=b.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, setting $Ux=y,$ we obtain\n\n$$\nL{{(Ux)}_{⏟}}_{y}=b\\,⟹\\,{\\begin{aligned}Ly=b \\\\ Ux=y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now solve $Ly=b.$ Writing this equation in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -4 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} \\\\ {y}_{2} \\\\ {y}_{3}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThis gives the system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1}=-2 \\\\ {y}_{1}+{y}_{2}=-1 \\\\ -{y}_{1}-4{y}_{2}+{y}_{3}=-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can compute the solution to this system using forward substitution, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{1} & =-2, \\\\ {y}_{2} & =-1-{y}_{1} \\\\  & =-1-(-2) \\\\  & =1, \\\\ {y}_{3} & =-3+4{y}_{2}+{y}_{1} \\\\  & =-3+4(1)+(-2) \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$y=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-107174/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9fa9fbb8-b2bc-5c93-bb07-bc8c7ef7c115"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107174"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105928/selection/3dd11f001a023120fb5905be9b6fd05246fab1eaf884d138500e7299e235265f" :answer/id #uuid "80ef11ca-5748-5584-a45c-0e0691130d73" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 15\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105928/selection/b445ab2d135ae9844c501be4613e7783f50c5c5b1827fc82b863ebfe01ae9a10" :answer/id #uuid "8a3d90d0-d170-5fd5-b024-7aac8f373a22" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105928/selection/0842f63b688ee12a937ce911b7f0dea73e99bd447ed32f25ed4f2828b4d7ad53" :answer/id #uuid "690bf126-090b-5102-95bc-f4a80871a60b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105928/selection/0839562539b7ba2d85f72accc1dd8cf88b31f89b0f601b8412de5f1fdc5606d4" :answer/id #uuid "21728b58-90de-55ba-8000-436d971398ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 15\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105928/selection/0ae33d9efd737dc3cc33aac18c28da4974e52c68d2746fa66c2ab0a01978d93c" :answer/id #uuid "83fb84e2-a967-55c8-86c5-35f26ee6c4d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 10 \\\\ 15\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105928/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0f3f89bc-6f02-532d-960c-28af7784a2ce" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-105928/selection/0839562539b7ba2d85f72accc1dd8cf88b31f89b0f601b8412de5f1fdc5606d4" :answer-field/choices ["q-105928/selection/3dd11f001a023120fb5905be9b6fd052